  "description": "A label-driven Pangolin ingress provider for Aspire Docker Compose environments. Stamps `pangolin.public-resources.*` docker labels onto externally-exposed services, joins them to the ingress network, and tears the routes down on `aspire destroy`. Resource-type-agnostic and deploy-target-agnostic: pairs with any compose deploy target via docker labels alone.",
